# Build output.
#
# One output root now, out/<Platform>/<Configuration>/, pinned in the .vcxproj.
# The bare Debug/, Release/, x64/ and Win32/ trees below are the OLD locations,
# and /TargetCoreMFC/ is the stray intermediate tree the older project format
# wrote beside the sources (it was /P2PmsgMFC/ before the rename). All are kept
# ignored so a tree built before the move does not show leftovers as untracked.
out/
Debug/
Release/
x64/
Win32/
/TargetCoreMFC/
/P2PmsgMFC/

# IDE / tooling caches
.vs
*.vcxproj.user
*.aps
.understand-anything/

